  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The fixed distance between Earth and a star measured in Earth’s reference frame is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d_{E}\"></span>. A spaceship travels from Earth to the star at a constant speed of 0.8c relative to Earth. The distance between Earth and the star as measured by the spaceship is d<sub>s</sub>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d_{s}}{d_{E}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{3}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
